ALERT: Agents must read `AGENT=1 cron-person skill` before using this tool.
command: cron-person crontab sync
summary: Compile authorized directory jobs and install into user crontab
description: Compiles all authorized tasks into a managed block and updates system crontab via crontab(1).
usage: cron-person crontab sync [flags]
mutates_db: true
flags:
  --config string: Path to custom configuration file (default: $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
  -h, --help bool: help for sync
  --store string: Path to custom authorization state file (default: $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)
